---
Create a new project record

Usage: rslbp project create [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          Human-readable project name

Options:
      --workspace <WORKSPACE>
          Optional workspace owning the new record

      --dry-run
          Preview the creation without calling the remote API

  -h, --help
          Print help
